  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 — Initial release\n• Striped async channel queue (one per CPU core)\n• MessageTemplate caching — zero parse cost after first call\n• LogEvent object pool — reduced GC pressure\n• Built-in PII masking (email, credit card, SSN, phone)\n• Correlation ID auto-propagation via AsyncLocal\n• Per-category log level overrides\n• MEL ILogger<T> compatible — no code changes needed\n• Full GitHub Actions Trusted Publishing support\nSee full changelog: https://github.com/SinkSharp/.github/blob/main/profile/CHANGELOG.md",
